	* relerr/main_nv.c: Use EnableWCTimer for StepTotWC.

	* libsw/poll.c (PollUntilDone): junk is a local variable.  When
	we call DllWait() to wait for it to be sent, we leave its
	scope.  Now we instead use a static global for the buffer.
	This was also a problem in the NLDone isend.  Finding this 
	bug is thanks to "setenv MP_EUIDEVELOP yes" which evidently 
	checks send buffer consistency.

	* Make-common/Make.pwr2:  Attempt to combine all CFLAGS and CC
	variants of ARCH into a single Makefile.


Mon Nov  7 12:33:05 1994  Mike Warren  (msw@sampson)

	* Make-common/Make.generic (libobj): Use $swsrc from Makefiles
	and get rid of Make.* in libsw

	* Make-common/Make.generic (extraexcludes): Change obsolete to 
	Obsolete and *.tgz to *gz.  Add NOT_PORTED.  "make dist" now
	makes a minimal distribution.
